      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "祖薈，晉衞將軍。",
      "reading": "祖王薈，晉衞將軍。",
      "note": "祖王薈，晉衞將軍。",
