      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "懌後娶南陽樂玄女，無子，改琨名，立以爲嗣。",
      "reading": "懌繼娶樂玄女無子，改琨名、立為嗣。生父始終為懌。",
      "note": "懌繼娶樂玄女無子，改琨名、立為嗣。生父始終為懌。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 34,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "琨少謹篤，爲從伯司徒謐所愛。",
      "reading": "少謹篤，司徒王謐是其從伯。",
      "note": "少謹篤，司徒王謐是其從伯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 14,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-14",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "宋永初中，武帝以其娶桓脩女，除郎中，駙馬都尉，奉朝請。",
      "reading": "宋武帝以琨娶桓脩女，除郎中、駙馬都尉。",
      "note": "宋武帝以琨娶桓脩女，除郎中、駙馬都尉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 14,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "元嘉初，從兄侍中華有權寵，以門戶衰弱，待琨如親，數相稱薦。",
      "reading": "元嘉初從兄王華提攜。",
      "note": "元嘉初從兄王華提攜。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 41,
      "end_codepoint": 70,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-70",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "爲尚書儀曹郎，州治中。",
      "reading": "任儀曹郎、州治中。",
      "note": "任儀曹郎、州治中。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 70,
      "end_codepoint": 81,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-81",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "累至左軍諮議，領錄事，出爲宣城太守，司徒從事中郎，義興太守。",
      "reading": "宣城、義興等太守及司徒從事中郎。",
      "note": "宣城、義興等太守及司徒從事中郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 81,
      "end_codepoint": 111,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-111",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "歷任皆廉約。",
      "reading": "歷任廉約。",
      "note": "歷任廉約。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 111,
      "end_codepoint": 117,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-117",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "還爲北中郎長史，黃門郎，寧朔將軍，東陽太守。",
      "reading": "北中郎長史、黃門郎、寧朔將軍、東陽太守。",
      "note": "北中郎長史、黃門郎、寧朔將軍、東陽太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 117,
      "end_codepoint": 139,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-139",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "孝建初，遷廷尉卿，竟陵王驃騎長史，加臨淮太守，轉吏部郎。",
      "reading": "孝建初遷廷尉卿，入竟陵王府，加臨淮、轉吏部郎。",
      "note": "孝建初遷廷尉卿，入竟陵王府，加臨淮、轉吏部郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
