      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "吏曹選局，貴要多所屬請，琨自公卿下至士大夫，例爲用兩門生。",
      "reading": "貴要託請；琨對公卿士大夫採每人兩名門生之例。",
      "note": "貴要託請；琨對公卿士大夫採每人兩名門生之例。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 167,
      "end_codepoint": 196,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence2-196",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "江夏王義恭嘗屬琨用二人，後復遣屬琨，答不許。",
      "reading": "江夏王劉義恭第一次請兩人，復請被拒。",
      "note": "江夏王劉義恭第一次請兩人，復請被拒。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p002",
