      "end_codepoint": 218,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "出爲持節、都督廣交二州軍事、建威將軍、平越將軍、平越中郎將、廣州刺史。",
      "reading": "出為都督廣交等官及廣州刺史。",
      "note": "出為都督廣交等官及廣州刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 35,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence3-35",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "南土沃實，在任者常致巨富，世云「廣州刺史但經城門一過，便得三千万」也。",
      "reading": "世人所說三千万是地方財利的諺語。",
      "note": "世人所說三千万是地方財利的諺語。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 35,
      "end_codepoint": 70,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence3-70",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "琨無所取納，表獻祿俸之半。",
      "reading": "琨不受財，獻俸半。",
      "note": "琨不受財，獻俸半。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 70,
      "end_codepoint": 83,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence3-83",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "州鎮舊有鼓吹，又啓輸還。",
      "reading": "舊置鼓吹，啟請輸還。",
      "note": "舊置鼓吹，啟請輸還。",
