      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "爲廷尉，加給事中，轉寧朔將軍長史、歷陽內史。",
      "reading": "還任廷尉等，歷陽內史。",
      "note": "還任廷尉等，歷陽內史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 134,
      "end_codepoint": 156,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "上以琨忠實，徙爲寵子新安王東中郎長史，加輔國將軍，遷右衞將軍，度支尚書。",
      "reading": "孝武以其忠實，調新安王東中郎長史，加輔國，後任右衞及度支。",
      "note": "孝武以其忠實，調新安王東中郎長史，加輔國，後任右衞及度支。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 36,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence4-36",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "出爲永嘉王左軍、始安王征虜二府長史，加輔國將軍、廣陵太守，皆孝武諸子。",
      "reading": "永嘉王、始安王兩府長史，輔國及廣陵，兩王為孝武諸子。",
      "note": "永嘉王、始安王兩府長史，輔國及廣陵，兩王為孝武諸子。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 36,
      "end_codepoint": 71,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence4-71",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "泰始元年，遷度支尚書，尋加光祿大夫。",
      "reading": "泰始元年465再遷度支，尋加光祿。",
      "note": "泰始元年465再遷度支，尋加光祿。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 71,
      "end_codepoint": 89,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "出爲冠軍將軍、吳郡太守，遷中領軍。",
      "reading": "吳郡太守、中領軍。",
      "note": "吳郡太守、中領軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 17,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence5-17",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "坐在郡用朝舍錢三十六萬營餉二宮諸王及作絳襖奉獻軍用，左遷光祿大夫，尋加太常及金紫，加散騎常侍。",
      "reading": "因郡朝舍錢三十六萬用於餉王及軍用，左遷，再加太常及金紫等。",
      "note": "因郡朝舍錢三十六萬用於餉王及軍用，左遷，再加太常及金紫等。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 17,
      "end_codepoint": 64,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence5-64",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "廷尉虞龢議社稷合爲一神，琨案舊糾駮。",
      "reading": "虞龢主張社稷合為一神，琨據舊制駁。南史並列異說。",
      "note": "虞龢主張社稷合為一神，琨據舊制駁。南史並列異說。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 64,
      "end_codepoint": 82,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence5-82",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "時龢深被親寵，朝廷多琨強正。",
      "reading": "虞龢受寵，朝廷稱琨強正。",
      "note": "虞龢受寵，朝廷稱琨強正。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 82,
      "end_codepoint": 96,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "明帝臨崩，出爲督會稽東陽新安臨海永嘉五郡軍事、左軍將軍、會稽太守，常侍如故。",
      "reading": "宋明帝臨崩，任會稽等五郡軍務，左軍、會稽守，常侍仍故。",
      "note": "宋明帝臨崩，任會稽等五郡軍務，左軍、會稽守，常侍仍故。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 38,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence6-38",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "坐誤竟囚，降號冠軍。",
      "reading": "因誤竟囚降冠軍。",
      "note": "因誤竟囚降冠軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 38,
      "end_codepoint": 48,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence6-48",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "元徽中，遷金紫光祿，弘訓太僕，常侍如故。",
      "reading": "元徽中金紫光祿、弘訓太僕。",
      "note": "元徽中金紫光祿、弘訓太僕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 48,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence6-68",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "本州中正，加特進。",
      "reading": "任本州中正，加特進。",
      "note": "任本州中正，加特進。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence6-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "從帝卽位，進右光祿大夫，常侍餘如故。",
      "reading": "從帝即宋順帝，進右光祿大夫。",
      "note": "從帝即宋順帝，進右光祿大夫。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 95,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence6-95",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "從帝遜位，琨陪位及辭廟，皆流涕。",
      "reading": "從帝辭廟遜位，琨陪位流涕。",
      "note": "從帝辭廟遜位，琨陪位流涕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 95,
      "end_codepoint": 111,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence6-111",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "太祖卽位，領武陵王師，加侍中，給親信二十人。",
      "reading": "齊太祖受禪後領武陵王師、侍中，給親信二十人。",
      "note": "齊太祖受禪後領武陵王師、侍中，給親信二十人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 111,
      "end_codepoint": 133,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence7-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "時王儉爲宰相，屬琨用東海郡迎吏。",
      "reading": "王儉屬請用東海郡迎吏。",
      "note": "王儉屬請用東海郡迎吏。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 16,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence7-16",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "琨謂信人曰：「語郎，三臺五省，皆是郎用人；外方小郡，當乞寒賤，省官何容復奪之。」",
      "reading": "信人傳話，兩個郎均指王儉；琨要求保留小郡職位給寒賤之人。",
      "note": "信人傳話，兩個郎均指王儉；琨要求保留小郡職位給寒賤之人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 16,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:received_sentence7-56",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "遂不過其事。",
      "reading": "未准所請。",
      "note": "未准所請。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 56,
      "end_codepoint": 62,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
