      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA",
      "source_quote": "琨性旣古慎，而儉嗇過甚，家人雜事，皆手自操執。",
      "reading": "琨謹慎而儉嗇，家務親自辦理。",
      "note": "琨謹慎而儉嗇，家務親自辦理。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 23,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
